snapraid
------------------------------------------
SnapRAID is a backup program for disk arrays.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/amadvance/snapraid/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/amadvance/snapraid/archive/refs/tags/v15.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack snapraid-15.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./snapraid-15.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/snapraid-15.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/snapraid-15.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

